@startuml
title List-History-Read

skinparam borderColor #000000
skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam HyperlinkColor #0000EE
skinparam HyperlinkUnderline false
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam BoxBorderColor #555555

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #e0e5f0-#d1d9e6
  BorderColor #8b95a5
  BorderThickness 1
  RoundCorner 0
  Padding 6
  FontColor #111827
  Shadowing false
}

skinparam HyperlinkColor #0000EE
skinparam HyperlinkUnderline false

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBorderColor #555555
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ffffff
  ParticipantFontColor #000000
  ParticipantFontSize 14
  ParticipantPadding 20
  ArrowColor #111827
  ArrowThickness 1
  ArrowFontColor #000000
  ArrowFontSize 13
  GroupBorderColor #111827
  GroupBackgroundColor #eef2ff
  GroupBorderThickness 2
}

!define COLOR_GDA_1    #0078D460
!define COLOR_GDA_2    #8764B860
!define COLOR_PATIENT  #00950560
!define COLOR_APO      #00B7C360
!define COLOR_DIAG_FA  #f5a40360
!define COLOR_E_REZEPT #E7485660

!define COLOR_OK       #50E6FF25
!define COLOR_ERROR    #FF8C0035

actor GDA_1 as "GDA 1" COLOR_GDA_1
participant eDiag_FA as "e-Diagnose Fachanwendung" COLOR_DIAG_FA

autonumber
activate GDA_1 COLOR_GDA_1

== Liste lesen ==


GDA_1 -> eDiag_FA: GET /Bundle?parameter(s)

activate eDiag_FA COLOR_DIAG_FA
eDiag_FA -> eDiag_FA: Prüfung auf bestehende\nListe(n)

alt Liste(n) entsprechend der Suchparametern vorhanden
  eDiag_FA --> GDA_1: Bundle (type=searchset) mit zumindest einem Collection-Bundle
else keine Liste entsprechend der Suchparameter vorhanden
  eDiag_FA --> GDA_1: leeres Bundle (type=searchset)
else Fehler
  eDiag_FA --> GDA_1: OperationOutcome
  deactivate GDA_1
  deactivate eDiag_FA
end

note over GDA_1, eDiag_FA
Die Fachanwendung liefert die gespeicherte Liste 
(unverändert, inkl. aller referenzierten Ressourcen) oder ein OperationOutcome zurück.
end note

@enduml